    <edge source="阿青" target="范蠡">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 范蠡 (Fan Li) and 阿青 (A Qing) is characterized by mutual admiration, trust, and deep emotional connection. 范蠡, a prominent historical figure, is deeply impressed by 阿青's exceptional swordsmanship and has expressed significant appreciation and support for her skills. He has shown care and attention toward her, even attempting to recruit her, reflecting his recognition of her talents and value. He regards her affectionately, describing her as a younger sister and a close friend, which highlights the warmth and respect in their relationship.

On the other hand, 阿青 holds 范蠡 in high regard, expressing gratitude and trust toward him. Her feelings for 范蠡 extend beyond admiration, as she harbors deep emotions for him, even risking her life to protect him by shielding him from an assassination attempt. This act underscores her loyalty and the profound bond she shares with 范蠡. Additionally, she has openly expressed her fondness for him, further illustrating the depth of her affection.

Overall, the relationship between 范蠡 and 阿青 is marked by mutual respect, emotional depth, and acts of care and support, with both individuals valuing and cherishing each other in unique and meaningful ways.</data>
      <data key="d9">情感,提及</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1777541204</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
